      "message": "I find this difficult to understand ; I had to read the code several time to figure out that the point is to have this value null if and only if there is at least one VPN. Can we use some higher-level construct like `CollectionUtils.any()` ? You could say\n\n    final Set\u003cInteger\u003e exemptNetIdSet \u003d CollectionUtils.any(network, it -\u003e isVPN()) ? new ArraySet\u003c\u003e() : null;\n\nThen you can remove numVpn and the isVPN() branch of this loop and the test in l.9877.",
