      "message": "Yes, right.\nDuring the design discussion, Lorenzo noted that UID ranges do not overlap for VPN networks.\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1oIqVWZ5pmdD3jlGNJLVluyyv1y4Rznjg-Wxpl8ocF4A/edit?disco\u003dAAABTyFCtlo",
